00:13:55,133 --> 00:13:56,000
What the hell?

249
00:13:56,260 --> 00:13:57,160
My shadow!

250
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:03,877
No! No!

251
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:05,080
Don't do it!

252
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:18,060
The shadow of a man with a 300
million fairy bounty is all mine!

253
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:22,733
Now we'll create the most powerful
special zombie the world has ever seen!

254
00:14:30,700 --> 00:14:31,530
What?

255
00:14:31,613 --> 00:14:32,443
Return to the ship?

256
00:14:32,900 --> 00:14:35,157
You want us to go back on board the Sunny?

257
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,299
Yes, that's right.

258
00:14:36,460 --> 00:14:39,277
If your comrades have been
captured, I fear the worst.

259
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:43,277
By now, and if not very soon, they will
have surely had their shadow stolen.

260
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:45,877
But even if that's the
case, they won't die.

261
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:48,717
Their bodies will likely
be taken back to your boat.

262
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:49,630
You see this?

263
00:14:49,713 --> 00:14:51,327
They'll end up just like me.

264
00:14:53,580 --> 00:14:54,410
Wait!

265
00:14:54,493 --> 00:14:55,377
The shadow part, not the dead part!

266
00:14:55,460 --> 00:14:56,417
Yeah, yeah, I get it.

267
00:14:56,500 --> 00:14:58,100
Let's move on. Anyway,

268
00:14:58,520 --> 00:15:03,157
like you were saying, even if you have
your shadow taken, you won't die, right?

269
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:04,597
Yes, that would be correct.

270
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:08,357
But whenever it's taken, you immediately
weaken and lose consciousness,

271
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:10,381
usually for about two days or so.

272
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:12,277
If the victim is strong enough,

273
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:15,957
