you to return to yours.

275
00:15:18,580 --> 00:15:20,297
Any guess as to why they do this?

276
00:15:20,380 --> 00:15:21,210
Well,

277
00:15:21,293 --> 00:15:24,337
I would assume it's to prevent the victims
from trying to take back their shadows,

278
00:15:24,420 --> 00:15:25,250
correct?

279
00:15:25,333 --> 00:15:26,163
Yes,

280
00:15:26,246 --> 00:15:27,477
why don't they just kill them
while they're unconscious

281
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:30,619
and get it over with that's
something they cannot do

282
00:15:31,100 --> 00:15:32,477
Now this is important.

283
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:34,501
So be sure to pay close attention

284
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:36,830
Firstly.

285
00:15:37,780 --> 00:15:40,137
Even though the body and
shadow have been separated.

286
00:15:40,220 --> 00:15:43,377
They still represent one
being think of the shadow as a

287
00:15:43,460 --> 00:15:46,537
soul if the body dies the
shadow will disappear as well?

288
00:15:46,620 --> 00:15:49,137
Thusly killing the host
zombie in the process

289
00:15:49,220 --> 00:15:51,677
since they're trying to
build an army of minions.

290
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:53,857
This would certainly
not bode well for them

291
00:15:53,940 --> 00:15:54,770
Secondly,

292
00:15:54,900 --> 00:15:58,057
in the likely event that your friends
have had their shadows stolen,

293
00:15:58,140 --> 00:16:00,417
they would most definitely
still be alive and their

294
00:16:00,500 --> 00:16:03,912
bodies would be returned to
your ship as soon as possible.

295
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:10,840
Which is why the two of you must not
lose your shadows as well. If you do,

296
00:16:11,020 --> 00:16:13,037
all hope will be lost
and you'll be forced to

297
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:16,020
wander these seas
aimlessly for all eternity.

298
00:16:16,660 --> 00:16:18,697
While you have this window of opportunity,

299
00:16:18,780 --> 00:16:21,377
you should use it to attempt
to awaken your comrades.

300
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:26,060
Once you do you must regroup and
formulate a plan to reclaim their shadows

301
00:16:26,880 --> 00:16:30,300
Do you understand does all
of this make sense? Hmm?

302
00:16:31,340 --> 00:16:37,220
Yeah, I think so your shadow story wasn't
so crazy after all both of you take this

303
00:16:40,660 --> 00:16:41,780
What is it?

304
00:16:42,540 --> 00:16:45,200
The weakness of these zombies hmm.

305
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:48,137
You've seen its power
This was the weapon I

306
00:16:48,220 --> 00:16:51,377
used to defeat that spider
monkey their weakness, huh?

307
00:16:51,460 --> 00:16:52,290
Huh?

308
00:16:52,373 --> 00:16:53,388
What is this stuff, anyway?

309
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,660
It's ordinary salt.

310
00:16:56,340 --> 00:16:57,400
It's just salt?

311
00:16:58,020 --> 00:17:00,857
Not exactly what I had in mind
as the vanquisher of evil.

312
00:17:00,940 --> 00:17:02,157
Does it lift a curse or something?

313
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:04,897
Well, I suppose that would be
one way of putting it, yes.

314
00:17:04,980 --> 00:17:09,057
The reanimated life of these zombies is
brought about by a Devil Fruit power.

315
00:17:09,140 --> 00:17:12,617
And just as one who is a power
holder is weakened by seawater,

316
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:15,017
the salt that is contained
in that water can also be

317
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:17,757
used as a weapon to unbind
the shadow from a zombie?

318
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:19,657
leaving them permanently deceased.

319
00:17:19,740 --> 00:17:20,737
Okay, I get it.

320
00:17:20,820 --> 00:17:22,977
And when this spider monkey went down,

321
00:17:23,060 --> 00:17:24,937
that black thing that
floated out of him afterwards

322
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:27,297
was someone else's shadow
that he'd been given.

323
00:17:27,380 --> 00:17:29,957
To think something so simple
would be their weakness.

324
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:34,637
So in summation, in order to defeat the
zombies, simply throw salt in their mouths.

325
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:36,840
That's the trick. Salt. Mouth.

326
00:17:37,020 --> 00:17:38,017
Deader than dead.

327
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:38,930
Make no bother.

328
00:17:39,013 --> 00:17:39,843
Pardon me, Brooke.

329
00:17:39,926 --> 00:17:42,797
But how do you know so much about
this island and its residents?

330
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:45,351
And how do you know the zombies' weakness?

331
00:17:45,780 --> 00:17:49,277
It all relates back to an incident
on this island five years ago.

332
00:17:49,360 --> 00:17:51,520
The time when I lost my shadow.

333
00:17:52,020 --> 00:17:53,417
I was sent out to sea.

334
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:54,917
Just like all the others.

335
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,397
Luckily I awoke and was
able to retrace my path.

336
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,421
And return here.

337
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:09,637
Once I did.

338
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:12,120
I went ashore and began my battle.

339
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:16,580
I fought against

340
00:18:17,500 --> 00:18:19,559
The very zombie that had my shadow.

341
00:18:23,260 --> 00:18:26,142
Unfortunately, the outcome
was a crushing defeat.

342
00:18:29,220 --> 00:18:32,240
Because I vowed to survive
no matter what I faced.

343
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:33,400
I ran.

344
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:36,802
Even if it was shameful,
I had to keep on living.

345
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:39,220
I have an obligation, you see.

346
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:42,040
I was the only survivor of my crew.

347
00:18:43,360 --> 00:18:46,360
One day, I will escape these evil seas.

348
00:18:46,580 --> 00:18:50,168
and make good on the promises
made by myself and my comrades.

349
00:18:50,620 --> 00:18:53,600
Until then, I cannot die a second time.

350
00:18:55,780 --> 00:19:00,740
Sadly, living longer hasn't helped me to
keep my promises or reach my goal at all.

351
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:03,980
But this time, I'm back
and I won't run away!

352
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:07,181
Not until I defeat that
man and reclaim my shadow!

353
00:19:13,500 --> 00:19:16,400
I'm in a hurry, so please excuse me.

354
00:19:16,580 --> 00:19:18,380
I'll be on my way now.

355
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:19,617
Good luck to you.

356
00:19:19,700 --> 00:19:20,760
Hold on a second!

357
00:19:22,280 --> 00:19:24,357
While you're still in a mood to talk,

358
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:27,969
there's one more burning question
I still need an answer to.

359
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:36,500
Poor Luffy!

360
00:19:37,860 --> 00:19:39,040
What just happened?

361
00:19:39,420 --> 00:19:41,220
That's not possible. Is it?

362
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:43,477
His shadow!

363
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:45,377
He cut it off and took it!

364
00:19:45,460 --> 00:19:46,440
Wait a minute.

365
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:48,497
We've heard about this, haven't we?

366
00:19:48,580 --> 00:19:51,157
Didn't that skeleton say the
same thing happened to him?

367
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:53,777
Yeah, I remember he said
his shadow was stolen.

368
00:19:53,860 --> 00:19:56,095
Then this must be the guy that did it.

369
00:19:56,380 --> 00:19:57,337
I bet you're right.

370
00:19:57,420 --> 00:19:58,250
How awful.

371
00:19:58,660 --> 00:19:59,660
What's the trick?

372
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:01,664
It must be a Devil Fruit power.

373
00:20:03,780 --> 00:20:05,680
Promise it. Listen, you.

374
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:08,577
Don't make me keep repeating
myself over and over again.

375
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:12,189
You're not the least bit cute
when you talk, so don't do it.

376
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:16,057
This little guy is just
what I need to bring me

377
00:20:16,140 --> 00:20:18,277
one step closer to becoming
king of the pirates.

378
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:19,780
Right, Doctor Hawkback.

379
00:20:21,980 --> 00:20:24,377
Since the time I met you ten years ago.

380
00:20:24,460 --> 00:20:28,817
I've put all my time, resources,
and energy into making number 900.

381
00:20:28,900 --> 00:20:32,177
With that shadow, it will make
the greatest zombie of all time.

382
00:20:32,260 --> 00:20:36,500
With that power at your fingertips,
nothing will be beyond your reach.

383
00:20:37,500 --> 00:20:39,737
That means it will only
be a matter of time.

384
00:20:39,820 --> 00:20:42,077
Before I become the
cemetery king of the entire

385
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:46,497
world and I'll transform
all the cute creatures of

386
00:20:46,580 --> 00:20:48,777
the world into zombies
then I'll have an entire

387
00:20:48,860 --> 00:20:51,517
adorable kingdom full of
servants that never talk back.

388
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:52,430
That's right.

389
00:20:52,513 --> 00:20:53,817
It doesn't matter who the person is,

390
00:20:53,900 --> 00:20:56,817
how powerful they are or how
strong-willed they may be.

391
00:20:56,900 --> 00:21:00,557
Once their shadow is taken and placed
in another, they bow to your will.

392
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:03,037
Soon I'll fill the world with my servants.

393
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:06,337
If I'd had an army like that
before, I wouldn't have been.

394
00:21:06,420 --> 00:21:09,008
beaten by that idiot
Kaido in the new world.

395
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:12,499
I think it's about time we
open his eyes, don't you?

396
00:21:12,740 --> 00:21:15,980
Yoro, Nien, bow! Yes,
Master! What's your command?

397
00:21:16,280 --> 00:21:19,217
Go on ahead and open the door
to the special refrigerator.

398
00:21:19,300 --> 00:21:20,130
Right!

399
00:21:20,213 --> 00:21:21,043
As you wish, Master!

400
00:21:24,540 --> 00:21:26,500
It's almost time, sweet 900.

401
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:29,857
In but a few moments, your
eyes will open at last.

402
00:21:29,940 --> 00:21:33,277
The perfect shadow has finally
found its way to my doorstep.

403
00:21:33,360 --> 00:21:34,417
Spider-Mouse, come here!

404
00:21:34,500 --> 00:21:35,330
Yes!

405
00:21:35,413 --> 00:21:38,517
Take Straw Hat Luffy's body
and throw it back on his ship.

406
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:40,424
Make sure to remove those webs.

407
00:21:40,520 --> 00:21:42,344
We'll be in trouble if he dies.

408
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:43,550
Look at him!

409
00:21:43,633 --> 00:21:45,577
Wait, I have an urgent report to give you!

410
00:21:45,660 --> 00:21:46,490
What is it?

411
00:21:46,600 --> 00:21:51,188
Just moments ago, the spider monkey
Captain Tararon was defeated by intruders!

412
00:21:52,340 --> 00:21:53,170
