Huh, what does that matter as
long as his shadow wasn't removed?

414
00:21:57,260 --> 00:21:58,090
But that's just it!

415
00:21:58,173 --> 00:21:59,393
His shadow was removed!

416
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,697
