429
00:22:29,220 --> 00:22:30,260
That swordsman!

430
00:22:30,640 --> 00:22:34,220
That damned humming swordsman! Bastard!

431
00:22:34,380 --> 00:22:36,777
That infuriating troublemaker
is the only enemy

432
00:22:36,860 --> 00:22:39,397
