weakness of the zombies.

433
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:41,780
How did he manage to return here again?

434
00:22:41,920 --> 00:22:42,897
And what is she doing?

435
00:22:42,980 --> 00:22:47,140
How much damage has he managed to
do this time? Shandora! Stop that!

436
00:22:47,260 --> 00:22:48,907
Why do you keep blocking me?

437
00:22:49,360 --> 00:22:51,020
The Humming Swordsman.

438
00:22:51,740 --> 00:22:55,757
I've heard many stories about him,
but just what kind of a man is he?

439
00:22:55,840 --> 00:22:57,217
You don't mean that you've...

440
00:22:57,300 --> 00:22:59,677
Perona, are you saying you've
never seen his face before?

441
00:22:59,760 --> 00:23:01,180
I see then.

442
00:23:01,380 --> 00:23:04,537
That's probably how he slipped
past your ghost network undetected.

443
00:23:04,620 --> 00:23:05,973
Yeah, so it would seem.

444
00:23:08,700 --> 00:23:11,797
Master, apparently that humming
pain in the ass has returned.

445
00:23:11,880 --> 00:23:12,780
Like I care.

446
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:15,197
Don't bother me with such nonsense, idiot.

447
00:23:15,280 --> 00:23:16,140
I'm busy.

448
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:17,517
You take care of it.

449
00:23:17,600 --> 00:23:18,430
Hold on!

450
00:23:18,513 --> 00:23:20,924
Come on, let's make our
way to the refrigerator.

451
00:23:26,760 --> 00:23:29,878
Master, I have news concerning
the current situation.

452
00:23:31,080 --> 00:23:32,577
Why didn't you say so before?

453
00:23:32,660 --> 00:23:33,490
Cool!

454
00:23:33,573 --> 00:23:36,537
If that's the case, slowing
him down shouldn't be an issue.

455
00:23:36,620 --> 00:23:39,897
Keep me informed of any more
problems should they arise!

456
00:23:39,980 --> 00:23:42,568
Now hurry up and dump
Straw Hat on the boat!

457
00:23:46,860 --> 00:23:47,690
Idiot!

458
00:23:47,773 --> 00:23:48,603
Keep quiet!

459
00:23:48,686 --> 00:23:50,637
He lost his shadow!

460
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:51,777
That doesn't mean he's dead!

461
00:23:51,860 --> 00:23:53,860
Remember Brooke said so.

462
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:57,860
Kumasi! Hurry up!

463
00:24:00,180 --> 00:24:02,180
We can't just hop out right now!

464
00:24:02,380 --> 00:24:03,697
Wait for the right moment!

465
00:24:03,780 --> 00:24:05,997
It sounds like they have
plans for Luffy's shadow.

466
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:07,737
We need to keep hiding
in here to find out where

467
00:24:07,820 --> 00:24:10,408
