we can rescue it later!

468
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:21,120
To think that Tararan
was defeated. Impressive.

469
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:24,160
More importantly, where is the enemy?

470
00:24:24,440 --> 00:24:27,240
I must find them and slice them!

471
00:24:32,080 --> 00:24:33,080
Listen, Franky.

472
00:24:34,080 --> 00:24:35,140
What is it?

473
00:24:35,260 --> 00:24:36,777
You're wrong, I'm not crying!

474
00:24:36,860 --> 00:24:38,277
I'm not crying, you punk!

475
00:24:38,360 --> 00:24:39,980
Stop looking at me already!

476
00:24:40,920 --> 00:24:42,200
I wanted to know.

477
00:24:42,780 --> 00:24:44,604
Why did you ask him about that?

478
00:24:44,700 --> 00:24:45,582
Leave me alone!

479
00:24:45,840 --> 00:24:47,400
I have my reasons, okay?

480
00:24:47,900 --> 00:24:48,880
Ah, damn it!

481
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,457
I can't help it!

482
00:24:50,540 --> 00:24:52,660
I love that damn skeleton!

483
00:24:53,040 --> 00:24:55,600
He's the nicest guy in the whole world!

484
00:24:55,780 --> 00:24:56,980
It's not fair!

485
00:24:59,820 --> 00:25:00,720
That's true.

486
00:25:10,460 --> 00:25:13,620
You just don't know when to quit, do you?

487
00:25:14,040 --> 00:25:15,120
I'll never quit!

488
00:25:16,080 --> 00:25:17,777
Don't you remember who I am?

489
00:25:17,860 --> 00:25:22,860
Men cower in fear at the mere mention
of the Swordmaster Ryuma Silence!

490
00:25:23,220 --> 00:25:27,897
You're nothing more than my shadow
Yet my body is much stronger.

491
00:25:27,980 --> 00:25:31,400
I'll return you to where
you belong, beneath my feet!

492
00:25:32,500 --> 00:25:34,337
I'm looking forward to this.

493
00:25:34,420 --> 00:25:38,677
When I first came across this corpse in
the Land of Ice, I couldn't stop shaking.

494
00:25:38,760 --> 00:25:40,117
Honestly, I was trembling.

495
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:42,437
It's simply fascinating to think that such

496
00:25:42,520 --> 00:25:44,537
a monstrous creature
was alive and breathing?

497
00:25:44,620 --> 00:25:47,657
wreaking havoc across
the seas 500 years ago.

498
00:25:47,740 --> 00:25:50,916
The countries that fell at
his hands were taken whole.

499
00:25:51,120 --> 00:25:54,137
Under his strength, a legendary
nation of criminals was born.

500
00:25:54,220 --> 00:25:56,677
Imagine my surprise when
I found myself staring

501
00:25:56,760 --> 00:25:59,017
at the demon they called
the continent below.

502
00:25:59,100 --> 00:26:01,157
Man, it keeps getting colder and colder.

503
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:03,797
Where in the world were
these guys going anyway?

504
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:04,937
I have no idea,

505
00:26:05,020 --> 00:26:09,217
but they said something earlier about
some sort of special refrigerator,

506
00:26:09,300 --> 00:26:10,130
didn't they?

507
00:26:10,213 --> 00:26:13,217
I can't believe I'm going to
revive this extraordinary creature.

508
00:26:13,300 --> 00:26:15,837
This will go down in the
books of zombie creationists.

509
00:26:15,920 --> 00:26:18,120
Century, why do you keep blocking me?

510
00:26:18,340 --> 00:26:20,928
Another legend will be
brought back to life.

511
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:31,820
The time for his revival is finally here.

512
00:26:32,180 --> 00:26:34,560
Behold, the only warrior in history

513
00:26:35,320 --> 00:26:39,260
who was ruthless and powerful
enough to be given the name Devil.

514
00:26:40,540 --> 00:26:42,520
This is Oz.

515
00:26:46,660 --> 00:26:48,580
Thank you.
